<div class="rn">
<h2>What&#x27;s New in 6.4</h2>
<h3 class="hl">Highlights</h3>
<ul class="highlights">
<li><strong>A tool view you can actually read, for all 17 agents.</strong> Every tool call is one row with its command or path first, and parallel calls get a row each. Open one for decoded output that folds when long; exit codes and errors sit right on the row. Right-click to copy the command, the output or the raw event.</li>
<li><strong>Find matches what you see.</strong> A match inside folded output opens the fold, and Esc closes it again. The Errors filter steps through single failed calls.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>No more escaped slashes.</strong> Paths and URLs in tool calls read <code>/</code>, not <code>\/</code>.</li>
<li><strong>Codex output shows as text.</strong> Output stored as a list of text items now has real line breaks instead of raw JSON.</li>
<li><strong>Parallel tool outputs stay separate.</strong> They no longer merge into one block.</li>
</ul>
<p class="more">Full release notes: <a href="https://github.com/jazzyalex/agent-sessions/releases/tag/v6.4">https://github.com/jazzyalex/agent-sessions/releases/tag/v6.4</a></p>
